  "contentHtml": "\n<p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/3.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>Та эдгээр зургуудыг үзээд нэгийг бодох \nбизээ. Бидний өсөж төрсөн дэлхийн захад хаана ч байж болно. Ядуурал, \nДайн, Өлсөглөн, амиа хорлолт, аллага, золгүй явдал гээд зөндөө муу зүйл \nболж байна. Та дараах зургуудыг үзэж юу бодсоноо сэтгэгдэл дээр бичиж \nүлдээгээрэй. Бид нэгэн дэлхийд амьдарч буй нэг л гэр бүл.<!--break--></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/1.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/4.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/5.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/6.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/12.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/15.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/18.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/19.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/22.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/23.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/24.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://ochevidec.net/content/story34/100/25.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://2003.novayagazeta.ru/nomer/2003/77n/n77n-s07.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://www.sciam.ru/2005/12/img/bednost.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://wycliffe.ru/news/images/heart07.09/04.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://www.vokrugsveta.ru/img/cmn/2007/05/05/028.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://i21.photobucket.com/albums/b299/tim36430/blogspot/hannahmontana.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p><img src=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20120317140829im_/http://dusteye.files.wordpress.com/2007/03/baby.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
  "contentText": "Та эдгээр зургуудыг үзээд нэгийг бодох бизээ. Бидний өсөж төрсөн дэлхийн захад хаана ч байж болно. Ядуурал, Дайн, Өлсөглөн, амиа хорлолт, аллага, золгүй явдал гээд зөндөө муу зүйл болж байна. Та дараах зургуудыг үзэж юу бодсоноо сэтгэгдэл дээр бичиж үлдээгээрэй. Бид нэгэн дэлхийд амьдарч буй нэг л гэр бүл.",
